---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'About Printablery — Free Printable Bingo Cards';
const description = 'Printablery is a free tool for making and printing custom bingo cards for classrooms, parties, and events. Learn what it does and how it stays free.';
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} canonicalPath="/about/">
  <section class="wrap narrow" style="padding-top:2.2rem;">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1 class="mt0">About Printablery</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Printablery is a free tool for making printable bingo cards. It started from a simple, recurring problem: teachers, parents, and party hosts need a bingo game on short notice, and the options are either paid printables locked behind a download wall or blank templates you still have to fill in by hand.</p>
      <p>So the idea here is straightforward. Pick a theme and the words are already there. Change any of them, choose your grid size, and print a stack of cards that are all different from one another. No account, no watermark, no ten-step checkout — just a printable card in about a minute.</p>
      <h2>What you can make</h2>
      <p>The library covers the occasions bingo actually gets played at: holiday parties, classroom review games, baby and bridal showers, road trips, family reunions, and the meetings people quietly endure. Each theme ships with a ready-made word list you can use as-is or rewrite completely.</p>
      <h2>How it stays free</h2>
      <p>The core generator is free and supported by advertising. An optional Pro tier adds conveniences for heavy users — large bulk sets for a full classroom and one-click PDF export — but nothing you need to play a game is behind a paywall.</p>
      <h2>Feedback</h2>
      <p>Printablery is actively maintained and new themes get added over time. If a theme you'd love to see is missing, that's useful to know — the theme list grows based on what people actually reach for.</p>
      <p><a href="/bingo/">Try the generator →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
